hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1176","Musa bin Abdul Rahman Al-Masruqi told us, Husayn bin Ali told us, on the authority of Zaida, on the authority of Hisham, on the authority of Ibn Sirin, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, who said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Do not single out Friday as a fast among the days, and do not single out Friday night.” “By staying awake in the middle of the nights.”"
